# Components & SEO rules

## Components
- Server Components by default; `"use client"` only for interactivity
- Use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` for class merging
- Use design system from `components/ui/` — extend there if a primitive is missing globally
- Tool shell changes (`components/tool/`) affect ALL tools — justify globally

## Accessibility
- Labels on all inputs; `aria-invalid` + `role="alert"` for errors
- Visible focus states; keyboard-accessible buttons
- `aria-live="polite"` on dynamic results (use `ToolResultsSection`)
- Semantic HTML: one H1 per page, no skipped heading levels

## SEO
- Pages: export metadata via `createMetadata()` from `@/lib/seo`
- Tools: metadata generated in `app/tools/[slug]/page.tsx` from registry — do not duplicate
- JSON-LD via `JsonLd` component + helpers in `lib/seo/json-ld.ts`
- Canonical URLs via `getSiteUrl()` / `absoluteUrl()` — never hardcode domain

See `docs/ENGINEERING_PLAYBOOK.md` §5–7.
